{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "TOTAL DRIFTIN': Touge Dreams",
    "steam_appid": 3719540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.poster.avif?t=1751048692\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.webm?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.mp4?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.<br>Precise physics with accessible controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/5185c268f9187bc8894edc46ab1fdfbd.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drifting system strikes a balance between realism and flow, making touge mastery an art \u2014 not a fight against the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a carefully crafted selection of cars inspired by drifting legends. Each one has its own handling and character. No complicated customization \u2014 just you and the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack pays tribute to the VHS and neon era with a soundtrack that follows every descent like a scene from an anime. <br><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> isn\u2019t just a racing game. It\u2019s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night\u2026 and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.poster.avif?t=1751048692\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.webm?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.mp4?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.<br>Precise physics with accessible controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/5185c268f9187bc8894edc46ab1fdfbd.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drifting system strikes a balance between realism and flow, making touge mastery an art \u2014 not a fight against the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a carefully crafted selection of cars inspired by drifting legends. Each one has its own handling and character. No complicated customization \u2014 just you and the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1751048692\" data-has-big width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack pays tribute to the VHS and neon era with a soundtrack that follows every descent like a scene from an anime. <br><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> isn\u2019t just a racing game. It\u2019s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night\u2026 and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>",
    "short_description": "Master each corner, burn rubber, and become a legend high in the Japanese mountains. Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams is a tribute to classic '90s drifting, with precise physics, retro aesthetics, and a cult-like soul. Do you have what it takes to become a touge god?",
